# Local Claude Code tooling (hooks, settings) — not part of the shipped project
.claude/*
# …except skills: their procedure files are the reviewable body of each skill
# (e.g. codeyam-audit/finalize-procedure.md), so they must be version-controlled
# rather than living as untracked per-machine state.
!.claude/skills/

# CodeYam editor UI scaffolding — generated tooling artifacts, not app code
ui/

